      "page": 1, "locator": "synthetic://pathway/source#localization",
      "text": "Extracellular region contains the ligand Ligand L. Plasma membrane contains the receptor Receptor R. Cytosol contains the protein Kinase A and the protein Factor B. Nucleus contains the protein Regulator C."
    },
    {
      "id": "src-edges",
      "page": 1, "locator": "synthetic://pathway/source#interactions",
      "text": "Ligand L binds Receptor R. Receptor R activates Kinase A. Receptor R activates Factor B. Kinase A phosphorylates Regulator C. Regulator C inhibits Receptor R as a feedback branch."
    }
